{"appid": 2870340, "gama": {"steamId": 2870340, "id": 2870340, "name": "Decktamer", "copiesSold": 167224, "unreleased": false, "earlyAccess": false, "firstReleaseDate": 1761523200000, "releaseDate": 1761523200000, "price": 15.99, "developers": ["Horizon Edge"], "publishers": ["Assemble Entertainment"], "publisherClass": "Indie", "reviewScore": 86, "genres": ["Strategy"], "tags": ["Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Creature Collector", "Card Game", "Card Battler", "Turn-Based Combat", "Deckbuilding", "Strategy", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Difficult", "2D", "Fantasy", "Hand-drawn", "Controller", "Singleplayer", "Horror", "Roguelike", "Lovecraftian", "Indie", "Cartoony", "Colorful"]}, "store": {"type": "game", "name": "驯牌师 Decktamer", "steam_appid": 2870340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>路线图</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/34ac11a288d5bb6cce37ff913f07c521.avif?t=1791198030\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras_big/34ac11a288d5bb6cce37ff913f07c521.avif?t=1791198030 width=1560 height=1160 /></span></p></p><br><h1>关于游戏</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/b8f0030d41ed9a8818096c0688b3744c.poster.avif?t=1791198030\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/b8f0030d41ed9a8818096c0688b3744c.webm?t=1791198030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/b8f0030d41ed9a8818096c0688b3744c.mp4?t=1791198030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>在这款融合卡组构筑与怪物捕捉元素的回合制Roguelike中，击败敌人、收服卡牌，与它们一同踏入深渊。你会选择消灭，还是驯服？</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在《训牌师Decktamer 》中，你将遭遇那些早已适应深渊环境的怪物。据说，凡是能到达巨型深坑底部的勇者，都将获得丰厚的回报。但随着你的深入，怪物也变得愈发怪异且危险……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/c70f3c54481ee8bde1f0d08c1842846d.avif?t=1791198030\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras_big/c70f3c54481ee8bde1f0d08c1842846d.webp?t=1791198030 width=1600 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在这款游戏中，卡牌不会被自动送出，只有驯服敌人，才能将它们加入卡组。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >但要注意，一旦你的生物死亡，那张卡也会永久消失！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/67cb41215b86650529ba723454c65c0c.poster.avif?t=1791198030\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/67cb41215b86650529ba723454c65c0c.webm?t=1791198030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/67cb41215b86650529ba723454c65c0c.mp4?t=1791198030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/8491db6906cde62524bb7edb3227bab8.avif?t=1791198030\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras_big/8491db6906cde62524bb7edb3227bab8.webp?t=1791198030 width=1600 height=249 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每回合，你的每张卡牌都能使用一次技能。在这个回合制战斗系统中，找出最佳解法赢得胜利！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >但局势真的会如你预想的发展吗？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/b00d7b7d155c955b5f2492befb007093.poster.avif?t=1791198030\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/b00d7b7d155c955b5f2492befb007093.webm?t=1791198030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/b00d7b7d155c955b5f2492befb007093.mp4?t=1791198030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/0eed08af35e7cee18f93b9b00c260305.avif?t=1791198030\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras_big/0eed08af35e7cee18f93b9b00c260305.webp?t=1791198030 width=1600 height=249 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >深渊中充满了拥有异常能力的变异怪物。善加利用，将它们的能力转移到其他生物身上，创造出独特且强力的连携组合！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/b1c211bd98d9678cab028df2b2bab14b.poster.avif?t=1791198030\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/b1c211bd98d9678cab028df2b2bab14b.webm?t=1791198030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/b1c211bd98d9678cab028df2b2bab14b.mp4?t=1791198030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >只剩一个问题……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>你，是否能抵达深渊的核心呢？</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/b23955851b62bf54a5db441e04874123.avif?t=1791198030\" width=600 height=219 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/b8f0030d41ed9a8818096c0688b3744c.poster.avif?t=1791198030\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/b8f0030d41ed9a8818096c0688b3744c.webm?t=1791198030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/b8f0030d41ed9a8818096c0688b3744c.mp4?t=1791198030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>在这款融合卡组构筑与怪物捕捉元素的回合制Roguelike中，击败敌人、收服卡牌，与它们一同踏入深渊。你会选择消灭，还是驯服？</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在《训牌师Decktamer 》中，你将遭遇那些早已适应深渊环境的怪物。据说，凡是能到达巨型深坑底部的勇者，都将获得丰厚的回报。但随着你的深入，怪物也变得愈发怪异且危险……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/c70f3c54481ee8bde1f0d08c1842846d.avif?t=1791198030\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras_big/c70f3c54481ee8bde1f0d08c1842846d.webp?t=1791198030 width=1600 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在这款游戏中，卡牌不会被自动送出，只有驯服敌人，才能将它们加入卡组。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >但要注意，一旦你的生物死亡，那张卡也会永久消失！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/67cb41215b86650529ba723454c65c0c.poster.avif?t=1791198030\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870340/extras/67cb41215b86650529ba723454c65c0c.webm?t=1791198030\" type=\"video/webm; codec